flowchart TD
    KB["📚 Knowledge Base (~/.pi/knowledge-base)
    Article .md files with frontmatter tags"] --> SCAN["kb‑skills Extension
    resources_discover hook"]

    SCAN --> FILTER["Filter skill‑source articles
    Checks: type:skill, kind:skill-source, skill:enabled"]

    FILTER --> VALIDATE["Validate article
    - skill_ref & skill_name tags present
    - embedded frontmatter name matches skill_name
    - non‑empty description and body"]

    VALIDATE -->|Valid| CACHE["Write to cache directory
    ~/.cache/pi/kb-skills/<skill-name>/
      ├── SKILL.md
      └── SOURCE.json"]

    VALIDATE -->|Invalid| SKIP["Skip article
    (no generated skill)"]

    CACHE --> DISCOVER["🔁 resources_discover returns
    generated skill paths to pi runtime"]

    DISCOVER --> PI["🧠 pi runtime loads skills
    from generated directories"]

    KB --> SAVE["kb_save_skill tool
    Creates linked doc + source articles"]
    SAVE --> KB
